                                                "sense_id": "e21da06e-df0c-3878-babe-919140f2ef91",
                                                "text": "Gagnon (1990; Gagnon & Simon, 1973) proposed important and relevant differences in sexual scripts stemming from women's socialisation into heterosociality before heterosexuality, in contrast to men's socialisation into masturbation and heterosexuality before heterosociality."
                                            },
                                            {
